    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2DHM7q6d8DsGPYUZf86RfHK)_\n\nThe merge markers in `load-order.org` were already removed on main by Sia's two web edits (7c68c22, 75a95ed). This PR fixes what was left: the Late cluster of the diagram and the prose still named `sp-dgraphs`, `sp-relationship-annotator`, `sp-dyn-graph` and `sp-relationship-annotator-live`, which `init.el` now replaces with `sp-graphs`. Only the module names change.\n\n`dot` is not installed in this environment, so the diagram was not rendered locally; CI `build` will check it.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01UCdhuFwktzufgjzkgvwHhJ)_",
